Corresponds to the AHCI PxSNTF register of the Advanced Host Controller Interface 1.2 (the data sheet uses its own names).

Data sheet 14.7.7 SATA_PORT_SNTF (offset 0x3C + n x 0x80, printed page 14-124, `datasheet.txt` line 58680).";

            enum SATA_PORT_SNTF_pxsntf_pmn_enum {
